\begin{tabular}{|c|c|} \hline
**Track parameter** & **value** \\ \hline Distance of closed approach & \(|\)DCA\(|\)\(<\) 3.0 cm \\ Number of fit points & nHitsFit \(\geq\) 15 \\ nHitsFit/nHitsPoss & Ratio \(\geq\) 0.52 \\ Transverse Momentum & \(p_{T}\geq\) 0.2 (GeV/c) \\ Pseudorapidity & \(|\eta|<\) 1.0 \\ \hline \end{tabular}
\end{table}
